  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "Afternoon, doctor. I'm hot and short of breath.\nMy heart is racing. The street numbers were doing the same thing.\nPerhaps I wore myself out chasing number twelve."
